        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion BD-C9, Bella Villa Collection Venetian Lever with Victorian Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Venetian Lever with Round Victorian Rose is available in 5 finishes. It is a very ornate leverset that will be sure to add class to any door in your home. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions. Fusions BD-C9 Bella Villa Collection Venetian Lever with Victorian Rose will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion BD C9 Ornate Bella Villa Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass/Bronze Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>”Positive Stop” lever spring mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Ornate Venetian Leverset with Round Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Venetian Lever with Round Victorian Rose, Fusion BD-C9",
                "description": "Fusion BD-C9, Venetian Lever with Round Victorian Rose - The Venetian Lever with Round Victorian Rose is available in 5 finishes. It is a very ornate leverset that will be sure to add class to any door in your home. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions. Fusions BD-C9 Bella Villa Collection Venetian Lever with Victorian Rose will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.",
